[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087178029","pull_request_review_id":2837362676,"id":2087178029,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc58Z88t","diff_hunk":"@@ -1916,7 +1916,7 @@ void fragment_shader(in SceneData scene_data) {\n \t\tvec3 bent_normal = normal;\n #endif\n \t\tvec3 ref_vec = normalize(reflect(-view, bent_normal));\n-\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness);\n+\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness * roughness * roughness);","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered.glsl","commit_id":"be01c7f5a4bc5e52801347145850cb5723add2cc","original_commit_id":"40c72ce0b0f5e19ee319d050443aab3f27186fe3","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm not sure if this comment is correct, but we should have some kind of comment to explain why this is done. Seeing `roughness^4` isn't common in the wild after all :slightly_smiling_face: \r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n\t\t// Scale perceptual roughness (`roughness * roughness`) back to linear\r\n\t\t// roughness, and also multiply it by a power of 2 to prevent the box projection\r\n\t\t// from being stretched at higher roughness levels.\r\n\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness * roughness * roughness);\r\n```","created_at":"2025-05-13T16:03:34Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T16:03:46Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087178029","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087178029"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087178029"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087178029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1920,"original_line":1920,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":6,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087178123","pull_request_review_id":2837362836,"id":2087178123,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc58Z8-L","diff_hunk":"@@ -1401,7 +1401,7 @@ void main() {\n \t\tvec3 bent_normal = normal;\n #endif\n \t\tvec3 ref_vec = normalize(reflect(-view, bent_normal));\n-\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness);\n+\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness * roughness * roughness);","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_mobile/scene_forward_mobile.glsl","commit_id":"be01c7f5a4bc5e52801347145850cb5723add2cc","original_commit_id":"40c72ce0b0f5e19ee319d050443aab3f27186fe3","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Same as above.","created_at":"2025-05-13T16:03:38Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T16:03:38Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087178123","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087178123"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087178123"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087178123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1405,"original_line":1405,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":6,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087578899","pull_request_review_id":2838038566,"id":2087578899,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc58be0T","diff_hunk":"@@ -1916,7 +1916,7 @@ void fragment_shader(in SceneData scene_data) {\n \t\tvec3 bent_normal = normal;\n #endif\n \t\tvec3 ref_vec = normalize(reflect(-view, bent_normal));\n-\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness);\n+\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness * roughness * roughness);","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered.glsl","commit_id":"be01c7f5a4bc5e52801347145850cb5723add2cc","original_commit_id":"40c72ce0b0f5e19ee319d050443aab3f27186fe3","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> I'm not sure if this comment is correct\r\n\r\nAdding a comment here sounds like a good idea. I don't think we're just doing `linear_roughness^2` to prevent the box projection stretching, but if I understand correctly that's just the correct dominant direction equation. I'm definitely not entirely sure either though.\r\n\r\nIt may be best for @clayjohn to chip in here since he's probably the only one who properly understands what's happening here. 😅","created_at":"2025-05-13T20:26:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T20:26:28Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087578899","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087578899"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087578899"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087578899/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1920,"original_line":1920,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2087178029,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":6,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087666014","pull_request_review_id":2838181499,"id":2087666014,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc58b0Fe","diff_hunk":"@@ -1916,7 +1916,7 @@ void fragment_shader(in SceneData scene_data) {\n \t\tvec3 bent_normal = normal;\n #endif\n \t\tvec3 ref_vec = normalize(reflect(-view, bent_normal));\n-\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness);\n+\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness * roughness * roughness);","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered.glsl","commit_id":"be01c7f5a4bc5e52801347145850cb5723add2cc","original_commit_id":"40c72ce0b0f5e19ee319d050443aab3f27186fe3","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"For posterity I will give a bit of background before making my recommendation. \r\n\r\nThe original suggestion for this change comes from the \"Moving Frostbite to PBR\" slides. They recommend:\r\n```\r\nvec3 GetSpecularDominantDir(vec3 normal, vec3 reflection, float roughness) {\r\n    float smoothness = 1.0 - roughness;\r\n    float lerpFactor = smoothness * (sqrt(smoothness) + roughness);\r\n    return mix(normal, reflection, lerpFactor);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nFilament simplified that to (in https://github.com/google/filament/pull/1563):\r\n\r\n```\r\nvec3 getSpecularDominantDirection(const vec3 n, const vec3 r, float roughness) {\r\n    return mix(r, n, roughness * roughness);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nClaiming that it was both more accurate and faster. \r\n\r\nWe copied the filament approach, but accidentally used percuptual roughness when the function takes linear roughness\r\n\r\n_Purple: Godot master_\r\n_Blue: Frostbite_\r\n_Green: Filament (improved)_\r\n<img width=\"488\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-05-13 at 2 23 32 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ece29762-6932-4f5a-9551-db72ff7632ab\" />\r\n\r\nYou can see that they basically use the same curve except in Godot we have a much higher value at low roughness. \r\n\r\nThis value specifies how much to blend between the mirror reflection direction and the normal direction. At a roughness of 1 we should read from the normal direction and at roughness 0 we should have mirror reflections. \r\n\r\nThe side-effect of this meant that Godot was flattening mirror reflections prematurely. \r\n\r\nFor a comment, I would just say:\r\n\r\n```\r\n // Interpolate between mirror and rough reflection by using linear_roughness * linear_roughness.\r\n```\r\nThis keeps things simple","created_at":"2025-05-13T21:31:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T21:31:28Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087666014","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087666014"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087666014"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087666014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1920,"original_line":1920,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2087178029,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":6,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087680488","pull_request_review_id":2838203844,"id":2087680488,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc58b3no","diff_hunk":"@@ -1916,7 +1916,7 @@ void fragment_shader(in SceneData scene_data) {\n \t\tvec3 bent_normal = normal;\n #endif\n \t\tvec3 ref_vec = normalize(reflect(-view, bent_normal));\n-\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness);\n+\t\tref_vec = mix(ref_vec, bent_normal, roughness * roughness * roughness * roughness);","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered.glsl","commit_id":"be01c7f5a4bc5e52801347145850cb5723add2cc","original_commit_id":"40c72ce0b0f5e19ee319d050443aab3f27186fe3","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As a bonus, here is a graph with the most correct approximation and it affirms that the filament approximation is probably what we want to go with since it suppresses the normal until a much higher roughness level\r\n\r\n<img width=\"348\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-05-13 at 2 44 39 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bcdbfe4f-3d5d-4453-b54c-c86629749fec\" />\r\n\r\nhttps://www.desmos.com/calculator/4gdtixpuef","created_at":"2025-05-13T21:45:40Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T21:46:38Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087680488","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087680488"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106241#discussion_r2087680488"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106241"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2087680488/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1920,"o